    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-xl border border-rural-800 p-5"><h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-rural-400">Dados</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm">ana@rural.edu.br</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-rural-400">Cadastro em 12 nov 2026</p></article><article class="rounded-xl border border-rural-800 p-5"><h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-rural-400">Papel</h2><p class="mt-4 font-bold">Administrador</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-rural-400">Conta ativa</p></article><article class="rounded-xl border border-rural-800 p-5"><h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-rural-400">Atividade recente</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm">3 vídeos publicados</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-rural-400">Último acesso hoje</p></article></div>
